<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>GameMind AI - 🎮🤖</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        
        body {
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', Tahoma, Geneva, Verdana, sans-serif;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f172a 0%, #1e1b4b 50%, #0f172a 100%);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }
        
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            padding: 40px 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        
        h1 {
            font-size: 4em;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #00d4ff, #7928ca, #ff006e);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            background-clip: text;
            animation: pulse 2s ease-in-out infinite;
        }
        
        .tagline {
            font-size: 1.5em;
            margin-bottom: 40px;
            color: #cbd5e1;
        }
        
        .features {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin: 50px 0;
        }
        
        .feature {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .feature:hover {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
            border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.6);
            transform: translateY(-5px);
        }
        
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .feature-title {
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
        }
        
        .feature-desc {
            font-size: 0.9em;
            color: #94a3b8;
        }
        
        .api-section {
            background: rgba(30, 27, 75, 0.5);
            border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
            border-radius: 10px;
            padding: 30px;
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .api-section h2 {
            color: #a78bfa;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        
        .api-links {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }
        
        .api-link {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.4);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #60a5fa;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            font-family: 'Courier New', monospace;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
        
        .api-link:hover {
            background: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
            border-color: rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.6);
            color: #93c5fd;
        }
        
        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 15px 30px;
            margin: 10px;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-size: 1em;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
        
        .btn-primary {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea, #764ba2);
            color: white;
        }
        
        .btn-primary:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.5);
        }
        
        .btn-secondary {
            background: transparent;
            border: 2px solid #667eea;
            color: #667eea;
        }
        
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
        }
        
        .games-section {
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .games-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .game-card {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .game-card:hover {
            background: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.2);
            border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.6);
        }
        
        .game-icon {
            font-size: 2em;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        
        .game-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #93c5fd;
        }
        
        .ai-section {
            margin: 40px 0;
        }
        
        .ai-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(150px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
        
        .ai-card {
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.1);
            border: 1px solid rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.3);
            padding: 15px;
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .ai-card:hover {
            background: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.2);
            border-color: rgba(168, 85, 247, 0.6);
        }
        
        .ai-name {
            font-weight: bold;
            color: #d8b4fe;
        }
        
        .status {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 20px 0;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        
        .status.online {
            background: rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.2);
            color: #86efac;
            border: 1px solid rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5);
        }
        
        .status.loading {
            background: rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.2);
            color: #facc15;
            border: 1px solid rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.5);
        }
        
        .footer {
            margin-top: 50px;
            padding-top: 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.2);
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 0.9em;
        }
        
        @keyframes pulse {
            0%, 100% { opacity: 1; }
            50% { opacity: 0.8; }
        }
        
        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            h1 { font-size: 2em; }
            .tagline { font-size: 1.1em; }
            .features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <h1>🎮 GameMind AI 🤖</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Train. Play. Analyze. Improve.</p>
        
        <div class="status online">
            ✅ Platform Live & Running
        </div>
        
        <div class="features">
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🎮</div>
                <div class="feature-title">5 Games</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">Snake, Tic Tac Toe, Maze, Flappy Bird, Connect Four</div>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🤖</div>
                <div class="feature-title">5 AI Models</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">Q-Learning, DQN, PPO, A*, Minimax</div>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">📊</div>
                <div class="feature-title">Analytics</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">Real-time performance tracking</div>
            </div>
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-icon">🧠</div>
                <div class="feature-title">Explainable AI</div>
                <div class="feature-desc">Understand every decision</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="games-section">
            <h2>🎯 Available Games</h2>
            <div class="games-grid">
                <div class="game-card">
                    <div class="game-icon">🐍</div>
                    <div class="game-name">Snake AI</div>
                </div>
                <div class="game-card">
                    <div class="game-icon">⭕</div>
                    <div class="game-name">Tic Tac Toe</div>
                </div>
                <div class="game-card">
                    <div class="game-icon">🌀</div>
                    <div class="game-name">Maze Solver</div>
                </div>
                <div class="game-card">
                    <div class="game-icon">🐦</div>
                    <div class="game-name">Flappy Bird</div>
                </div>
                <div class="game-card">
                    <div class="game-icon">🔴</div>
                    <div class="game-name">Connect Four</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="ai-section">
            <h2>🧠 AI Models</h2>
            <div class="ai-grid">
                <div class="ai-card">
                    <div class="ai-name">Q-Learning</div>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-card">
                    <div class="ai-name">DQN</div>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-card">
                    <div class="ai-name">PPO</div>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-card">
                    <div class="ai-name">A* Algorithm</div>
                </div>
                <div class="ai-card">
                    <div class="ai-name">Minimax</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="api-section">
            <h2>🔌 API & Documentation</h2>
            <div class="api-links">
                <a href="https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/health" target="_blank" class="api-link">
                    ✅ Check Backend Health: https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/health
                </a>
                <a href="https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/api/docs" target="_blank" class="api-link">
                    📚 API Documentation: https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/api/docs
                </a>
                <a href="https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/api/games" target="_blank" class="api-link">
                    🎮 Get Games: https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/api/games
                </a>
                <a href="https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/api/ai-models" target="_blank" class="api-link">
                    🤖 Get AI Models: https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/api/ai-models
                </a>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div>
            <a href="https://github.com/shanakumari9341-create/shana_singh" target="_blank" class="button btn-primary">
                🔗 View on GitHub
            </a>
            <a href="https://gamemind-ai-api.onrender.com/api/docs" target="_blank" class="button btn-secondary">
                📖 API Docs
            </a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>🎮 GameMind AI - Train. Play. Analyze. Improve. 🤖</p>
            <p>© 2024 GameMind AI. All rights reserved.</p>
            <p>Built with ❤️ by Shana Kumar</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
